    22	    and the plain `startswith` answered False for it — the scope test
    23	    itself was a way out of the scope (pair-rail round 1, P1, both
    24	    lanes). MEASURED: no such entry exists on this tree, so the
    25	    widening moves no row; it removes a shape.
