   155	def _personal_path_read_nofollow(path: Path) -> Optional[PersonalPathBlob]:
   156	    """Read an entry git called a REGULAR FILE, refusing to follow a link.
   157	
   158	    `is_symlink()` then `read_bytes()` are two answers about two moments:
   159	    replace the file with a link between them and the read follows it
   160	    while the recorded classification still says "not a link" — enough
   161	    to scan a link's target as though it were file content, and (while
   162	    the rule waiver still existed) enough to earn it (pair-rail round
   163	    1, P1).
