   165	    inode the name pointed at, or it refuses because that name is a link.
   166	
   167	    A refusal is not an error here, it is a FINDING: git enumerated this
   168	    entry as a regular file and the filesystem disagrees, so the link is
   169	    scanned as a link — its TARGET STRING is the content matched, never
   170	    followed — and `is_symlink=True` travels with the blob. The target
   171	    may well be clean; what is closed is the path where a link was read
   172	    as the file it points at.
