   175	    `PersonalPathUnreadable` (errno EISDIR below), and so does a FIFO, a
   176	    socket or a device at the `S_ISREG` test, because git enumerated a
   177	    blob here and the disk holds something that is not one: an entry
   178	    this rule cannot read is an UNVERIFIED entry, not a clean one
