P2 — .claude/hooks/check_pair_rail.py:24; scripts/doctor.sh:1188
Moving the timeout default into _lib/_pair_rail_parts/part_03.py leaves doctor scanning only the facade. It now skips its timeout-coherence check. An adopter with a registration timeout below 210 seconds loses the warning about prematurely terminating the 180-second review. Minimal fix: update the lookup for the extracted implementation, retaining compatibility with older installations.

